    "intro_html":  "This is the fast-casual burrito you build at home for a fraction of the counter price, rice and beans and chipotle steak wrapped tight with a cool crema. The sour cream is swapped for Greek yogurt, which is where a lot of the protein comes from, and the steak gets its smoke from chipotle in adobo. Each one lands at about \u003cstrong\u003e388 calories\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e37 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e, in a tortilla with 18 grams of fiber for 5 grams of net carb. If you like our Steak Fajita Rice Bowls, this takes the same steak in a smokier, mission-style direction and folds it into a wrap.",
