    "shop_smart":  [
                       "\u003cstrong\u003eOne can of chipotle in adobo goes a long way.\u003c/strong\u003e You use a few spoons per batch and freeze the rest in a little bag. That single cheap can flavors this burrito and several others in the lineup.",
                       "\u003cstrong\u003eGreek yogurt replaces two things at once.\u003c/strong\u003e It stands in for sour cream and pushes the protein up, and the big tub is cheaper per ounce than the little cups. Buy plain and large.",
