    "make_it":  [
                    "Weigh your empty mixing pot and write the number down for portioning later.",
                    "Cook the rice per the package and set it aside.",
                    "Stir most of the chipotle in adobo with the cumin, the vegetable oil, half the lime juice, and the salt, and toss the sliced sirloin in it. Sear it hard in a hot pan and slice thin.",
